IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SRC PIC S9(3) VALUE -123.
01 WS-DST PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-DST.
